IdeaProbe
Maintained by MaKik.

This project derives portions of its collectors, HTTP retry utilities and source
normalization from AutoResearch (https://github.com/EvoMap/AutoResearch).
The upstream authors and citation are preserved in docs/UPSTREAM_CITATION.cff.
The original Apache License 2.0 is preserved in LICENSE.

The local Codex project-research workflow and standalone project restructuring
were developed for IdeaProbe in 2026. Upstream academic idea generation, Forge,
experiment runtime and dashboards have been removed from this distribution.
